  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Shen Cong Sheng bursts from the sea into a storm of tornadoes, lightning, eagles, and an immemorial thunder phoenix, then waves both hands as two translucent sound waves move around the battlefield like two sharp blades. He activates immortal killer move Aerial Sound Blades. Wherever those sound blades go, eagles and lightning are cut into two, and even the immemorial thunder phoenix is injured and moves back. One sound blade goes around Tong Hua and slits Zeng Luo Zi’s throat, taking his head. Another goes after Fang Yuan, who turns and charges the closest route to the thunder phoenix instead.",
